Output docs/demos/out/rules-terminal.webm
Set Shell "bash"
Set FontSize 18
Set Width 1400
Set Height 800
Set Theme "Catppuccin Mocha"
Set TypingSpeed 60ms

Type~ "nvim -n -i NONE docs/demos/isle/tour/tour.isle"
Enter
Hide
Sleep 2500ms
Type ":7"
Enter
Type "6l"
Show
Sleep 1500ms
Type~ ":IsleRules"
Enter
Sleep 3500ms
